  "description": "Amorique is a sophisticated display typeface defined by sharp high-contrast strokes, refined proportions, and distinctive sculpted terminals. Inspired by luxury editorials and classic fashion typography, the design combines slender vertical stems with graceful curves and geometric counters, creating a striking visual rhythm that feels both timeless and contemporary. The typeface features carefully crafted letterforms with subtle wedge serifs and expressive details that add character without compromising clarity.",
